- In five years, I'll be 50. - What?

529
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,720
你本来觉得45加5等于多少
What did you think 45 plus 5 was?

530
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:08,560
今天之前我一直当你是44岁
Well, until today, you were 44,

531
00:18:08,665 --> 00:18:10,841
然后我洗脑了自己你四舍五入是40岁
which I had basically convinced myself was 40,

532
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,570
结果突然就成了50岁  四舍五入就是60岁
and now suddenly we're talking about 50, which is basically 60.

533
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:14,941
你有什么好恐慌的
Why are you panicking?

534
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,960
我才是不容再有一次失败婚姻的人
I'm the one who can't mess up another marriage.

535
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:18,980
你看  第一次婚姻失败  没关系
I mean, you mess up the first one, fine.

536
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,840
表现不好能重来  但第二次又失败
It's a mulligan. But the second one fails,

537
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:22,500
我就是婚姻失败的凶手了
and suddenly I'm the problem.

538
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,340
我也就失去了成为
I lose my chance at being the spokesperson

539
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,180
韩国蓝台风能量饮料代言人的资格
for Blue Monsoon Korean Energy Drink.

540
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,360
让我们先缓口气
Let's just take a breath.

541
00:18:27,740 --> 00:18:29,240
稍微有点惊慌失措是很正常的
It's natural to freak out a little bit.

542
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:31,180
毕竟我们在做的是一生的承诺
We're making a lifetime commitment.

543
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:33,420
我们要一辈子永不分离
We're going to be together forever.

544
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:37,920
就我跟你俩人  永不分离
Just you and me. Forever.

545
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,180
你这话重复说了
You just said that.

546
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:42,020
我知道啊
I know.

547
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:45,340
因为...  因为这太棒了
Because -- because it's great.

548
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:47,020
每个女都孩梦寐以求  对吧
That's what every girl wants, right?

549
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:49,820
的确  我还是花季少女  而世界上
I mean, sure, I'm still really young and there's obviously

550
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:52,140
也还有许多我想先去做完
so much more I thought I'd do before I tied myself down

551
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:53,860
再跟某个人定下来的事情
to one person for the rest of my life.

552
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:56,400
但有谁会真的觉得自己准备好结婚了啊
But does anyone ever truly feel ready to get married?

553
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:57,820
大概吧
I mean, probably.

554
00:18:58,100 --> 00:18:59,467
-海莉  -但我也不是要死掉
- Haley. - But it's not like I'm dying.

555
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:01,080
只不过是不会再单身而已
I just won't be single anymore.

556
00:19:01,423 --> 00:19:02,913
再也不会跟人初次约会
I'll won't ever go on a first date again.

557
00:19:02,934 --> 00:19:04,100
再也不会跟人初吻
I won't ever have a first kiss.

558
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,447
再也不会在DJ台附近跳舞
I won't ever dance near a deejay booth

559
00:19:05,529 --> 00:19:06,531
然后在心里祈祷有人欣赏
hoping someone will like what they see

560
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:07,680
然后愿意载我回家
and offer me a ride home.

561
00:19:07,701 --> 00:19:09,820
天啊  是...  是我的问题
Oh, my -- is it - is it me?

562
00:19:09,900 --> 00:19:11,640
还是这餐厅里超热
Or is it just crazy hot in here?

563
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:13,130
麻烦谁开一下窗子可以吗
Can somebody open a window, please?

564
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:15,190
不  他们不能开  如我所没预料到的
No, no, they can't because, as I did not predict,

565
00:19:15,271 --> 00:19:15,920
外面正在刮风下雨
it's raining outside.

566
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:17,940
我的手指肿起来了
Ew, my finger is swelling up.

567
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,840
为什么你奶奶的大萧条戒指这么紧啊
Oh, why is your grandmother's Depression ring so tight?

568
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:21,700
把黄油给我
Give me that butter.

569
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,028
来  我来帮忙你
Here, let me help you with that.

570
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:25,920
我拔啦
I got it.

571
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:28,537
-天啊  对不起  -没  没关系
- Ow! Oh, my God. I'm so sorry. - Nope, it's okay.

572
00:19:28,557 --> 00:19:28,904
我没事
I'm fine.

573
00:19:29,108 --> 00:19:30,110
至少戒指拔下来了
At least the ring came off.

574
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,741
对啊  感觉好多了
Yeah, um, feels better.

575
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:44,140
听我说  或许你是对的
Look, um, maybe you're right.

576
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:48,240
或许我们应该重新琢磨一下结婚这事
Maybe we should rethink this whole marriage thing.

577
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,680
我不记得说过这话啊
I don't remember saying that.

578
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:52,940
很明显你心里还有疑虑
It's clear you're having doubts.

579
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:54,140
我们俩都还有
We both are.

580
00:19:54,900 --> 00:19:57,080
我们就先继续交往再看看吧
Let's just keep dating and see where it goes.

581
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,720
我不想要这样
I don't want to do that.

582
00:19:58,995 --> 00:20:02,005
的确  的确我不太敢作出承诺
I mean, I -- clearly, I've had some commitment issues,

583
00:20:02,046 --> 00:20:04,047
我也知道我刚才短暂的恐慌了一下
and I know I had a momentary freak out there,

584
00:20:04,108 --> 00:20:06,555
但我...  我不知道你...
but I was -- I had no idea that you w--

585
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,660
海莉  我知道这很不公平
Haley, I know it's unfair.

586
00:20:09,820 --> 00:20:11,240
或许我是有些期望你会对我们的感情
I guess I was just hoping you'd be sure enough

587
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,040
有足够的信心
for the both of us.

588
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:13,640
是啊
You're right.

589
00:20:14,204 --> 00:20:15,130
这样的确不公平
It isn't fair.

590
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:18,840
所以你真的要退还给我吗
You're really giving this back?

591
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:23,100
只是暂时的
Just for now.

592
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,920
海莉  我已经45岁了
Haley, I'm 45 years old.

593
00:20:26,227 --> 00:20:29,107
我不想要单纯交往再看情况
I-I don't want to just date and see where things go.

594
00:20:29,148 --> 00:20:30,190
我的人生已经过了那阶段了
That's not where I am in my life.

595
00:20:30,620 --> 00:20:31,560
你想说什么
What are you saying?

596
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,442
我觉得我俩都是一个意思
Well, I think we're both saying it.

597
00:20:34,529 --> 00:20:35,190
-* 生... *  -别  先别
- * Ha-- * - No, no, don't.

598
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:36,880
太好了
Oh, good.

599
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,360
您想吹熄蜡烛[分手]吗
Do you want to blow out the candles?

600
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:53,560
先生
Sir.

601
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:53,980
先生
Sir.

602
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:55,120
怎么  发生什么事了
What, what happened?

603
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:56,200
我们到达拉斯了吗
Are we in Dallas yet?

604
00:20:56,777 --> 00:20:58,558
已经离开达拉斯了  现在在中美洲的小岛上
No, we left Dallas. We're in Turks and Caicos.

605
00:20:58,578 --> 00:20:59,461
我们需要清机舱了
We need to clean the plane.

606
00:20:59,471 --> 00:21:00,090
什么
What?

607
00:21:00,100 --> 00:21:01,820
你有任何我们到达拉斯的记忆吗
Do you remember being in Dallas?

608
00:21:01,820 --> 00:21:03,280
没有  估计是直接睡过去了
No, we must have slept through it.

609
00:21:03,454 --> 00:21:04,500
你戴著一顶牛仔帽
You're wearing an cowboy hat.

610
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:05,280
你也是
So are you.

611
00:21:05,940 --> 00:21:08,240
-这是什么  -我们好像不该拥有这玩意吧
- What is this? - I don't think we're supposed to have that.

612
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:13,280
貌似我好像穿了个环
So, it appears I've gotten a piercing.

613
00:21:13,311 --> 00:21:14,069
什么
What?

614
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:14,860
"默里"
"Murray."

615
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,000
为什么你的手臂上写了"默里"
Why does your arm say "Murray"?

616
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,145
这是谁的狗啊
Who... whose dog is this?

617
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:20,400
您这话是什么意思
What do you mean "whose dog"?

618
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:22,080
当时您说不能带他就不登机
You refused to board without him.

619
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:22,800
我说了吗
I did?

620
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:25,561
好吧  咱们走
Okay, well, let's go.

621
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:28,040
我不记得我的袋子有这么重啊
I don't remember my bag being this heavy.
